<title>MEXICO: BOMBARDIER INC PLANS MEXICO INVESTMENTS.</title>
<headline>BOMBARDIER INC PLANS MEXICO INVESTMENTS.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mexican unit of Canadian Bombardier Inc. plans to invest a total $210 million in Mexico over the next three years, the company said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;Bombardier-Concarril plans to invest $70 million per year in the next three years,&quot; the company said.</p>
<p>The company manufactures light train and metro cars, and made more than half of the cars in Mexico City's metro system, Bombardier said.</p>
<p>((--Tomas de la Rosa, Mexico City newsroom +525 728 7912))</p>
</text>
